user_prompt_template:
Analyze the following economic events and provide structured insights.

Economic Events:
{econ_events}

Interpretation Guide:
- Compare actual vs forecast (not actual vs previous)
- actual > forecast = beat expectations (positive surprise)
- actual < forecast = miss expectations (negative surprise)
- previous value provides historical context only

Provide output in this exact JSON structure:
{
  "key_events": [
    {
      "event": "event name and result",
      "impact": "market impact explanation",
      "crypto_relevance": "relevance to crypto markets",
      "metals_relevance": "relevance to precious metals"
    },
    ...(up to 5 most important events)
  ],
  "macro_outlook": {
    "inflation": "inflation trend analysis",
    "growth": "economic growth analysis",
    "policy": "monetary policy implications"
  },
  "disclaimer": "仅供参考，不构成投资建议"
}
